HHIISSTTOORRYY
     This ccdd driver is based upon the ccdd driver written by Julian Elischer,
     which appeared in 386BSD 0.1.  The CAM version of the ccdd driver was writ‐
     ten by Kenneth Merry and first appeared in FreeBSD 3.0.

